# Big binary files go through Git LFS (GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB)
*.tgz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.fbx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.FBX filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Unity YAML files merge better as text
*.unity text eol=lf
*.prefab text eol=lf
*.asset text eol=lf
*.meta text eol=lf
